一昨日、昨日、今日と、明日と、明後日と この宴は続く
Day before yesterday, yesterday, today, tomorrow, day after tomorrow, this banquet continues...

296
00:29:31,604 --> 00:29:35,604
踊レ、歌エ、一心不乱に回レ！
Dance, sing, spin with single-minded devotion!

297
00:29:35,604 --> 00:29:39,104
今宵は雪月花
Tonight is Setsugetsuka!

298
00:29:51,104 --> 00:29:59,904
ハッハッハッハッハッハッハイヤ
Ha ha ha ha ha ha ha iya!

299
00:30:00,079 --> 00:30:02,879
ハッハッハッハッハッハッ
Ha ha ha ha ha ha!

300
00:30:02,879 --> 00:30:08,579
花で一つ、鳥で二つ 手打ち鳴らす
One for flowers, two for birds, clapping hands.

301
00:30:08,579 --> 00:30:14,679
風で三つ、嗚呼、月出て四つ 鳴らす鳴らす
Three for wind, ah, four for the moon coming out, clapping, clapping...

302
00:30:14,879 --> 00:30:20,579
花で一つ、鳥で二つ 手打ち鳴らす
One for flowers, two for birds, clapping hands.

303
00:30:20,579 --> 00:30:26,579
風で三つ、嗚呼、月出て四つ 鳴らす鳴らす
Three for wind, ah, four for the moon coming out, clapping, clapping...

304
00:30:27,879 --> 00:30:30,079
今は
Right now,

305
00:30:30,079 --> 00:30:33,279
回レ回レ回レ回レ回レ回レ回レ回レ回レ！
Spin, spin, spin, spin, spin, spin, spin!

306
00:30:33,279 --> 00:30:36,079
華麗に花弁 散らすように
Like scattering petals brilliantly,

307
00:30:36,079 --> 00:30:39,179
回レ回レ回レ回レ回レ回レ回レ回レ回レ！
Spin, spin, spin, spin, spin, spin, spin!

308
00:30:39,179 --> 00:30:41,879
髪も振り乱して
Disheveling your hair as well!

309
00:30:41,879 --> 00:30:45,379
一昨日、昨日、今日と、明日と、明後日と
The day before yesterday, yesterday, today, tomorrow, the day after,

310
00:30:45,379 --> 00:30:47,379
この宴は続く
this banquet continues!

311
00:30:47,379 --> 00:30:50,879
踊レ、歌エ、一心不乱に回レ！
Dance, sing, spin with all your heart!

312
00:30:50,879 --> 00:30:53,679
今宵は何曜日か？
What day of the week is it tonight?

313
00:30:53,679 --> 00:30:55,879
水木金？
Wednesday, Thursday, Friday?

314
00:30:55,879 --> 00:30:58,279
土日月火？
Saturday, Sunday, Monday, Tuesday?

315
00:30:58,879 --> 00:31:02,079
ハッハッハッハッハッハッハイヤ
Ha ha ha ha ha ha ha iya!

316
00:31:02,079 --> 00:31:04,879
ハッハッハッハッ いよ〜〜っ ぽん！
Ha ha ha ha, iyo... pon!

317
00:31:20,079 --> 00:31:25,079
宵々古今
[Song: Yoi Yoi Kokon]

318
00:31:31,879 --> 00:31:38,079
らっしゃいな 平和は成り 時が来た 正しき 夢現 夜もすがら
Welcome, peace has arrived! The time has come, a true vision of dreams through the night.

319
00:31:38,279 --> 00:31:44,879
変わりゆくことに 忘れじののっぴきならぬのはごめん
Amidst all the changes, forgive me for refusing to forget what cannot be avoided.

320
00:31:45,079 --> 00:31:51,079
手毬唄歌い 君達が誘う
Singing a handball song, you all beckon me.

321
00:31:51,279 --> 00:31:57,879
徒に後ろ髪を引かれても進むべきなり
Even if pulled back by regret, I must keep moving forward.

322
00:31:58,079 --> 00:32:03,879
流行り廃りの浮き世なら
If this fleeting world is full of fading trends,

323
00:32:04,079 --> 00:32:09,579
信ずる者はただ君だけと
then the only one I believe in is you.

324
00:32:10,079 --> 00:32:16,879
踊り騒ぎや 飲みや歌いや 案ずることなどないな この世
Dance and make noise, drink and sing, there's nothing to worry about in this world!

325
00:32:16,879 --> 00:32:20,079
人の世は恨めしい 節操はちゃらちゃら
The human world is bitter, integrity is fickle and frivolous.

326
00:32:20,079 --> 00:32:23,579
騙し騙されて 満身創痍で それそれそれそれ
Deceiving and being deceived, covered in wounds—sore, sore, sore, sore!

327
00:32:24,079 --> 00:32:27,079
今を咲いて 昔を憂いて
Blooming in the present, grieving the past,

328
00:32:27,079 --> 00:32:29,079
己の心の内
within my own heart...

329
00:32:29,079 --> 00:32:30,879
滾る涙川
a boiling river of tears.

330
00:32:30,879 --> 00:32:33,279
それじゃ叶わん 過去に蹴回
That won't do! Kick away the past,

331
00:32:33,279 --> 00:32:37,579
目眩く日々に 君を連れて
and take you with me into these dazzling days!

332
00:32:51,079 --> 00:32:56,879
あまりてなどか いと悲しき 身勝手なのが世の理か
Why is it so painfully sad? Is selfishness simply the way of the world?

333
00:32:57,079 --> 00:33:03,279
万人持つ理想 刻まんど 拙き答えなどはあらざらん
Etching the ideals held by all, there is no such thing as a clumsy answer.

334
00:33:03,579 --> 00:33:09,579
巡り巡りあうこと まさに一期一会
Meeting again and again across time is truly a once-in-a-lifetime encounter.

335
00:33:10,079 --> 00:33:16,079
試練 試練 甘いも辛いも 連れ添ってこの手握って
Trials and tribulations, sweet and bitter—stay by my side and hold this hand.

336
00:33:16,079 --> 00:33:22,579
生きづらいこと 浮き世から 旗を掲げよ
From this hard-to-live floating world, raise high the flag!

337
00:33:26,079 --> 00:33:28,879
宵闇が明く
The twilight brightens...

338
00:33:29,079 --> 00:33:34,079
踊り上がり 照れは忘れる 昔も今も変わらず浮き世
Dance up, forget your shyness! Past or present, the floating world never changes.

339
00:33:34,079 --> 00:33:38,079
人の世は悲しい いつだってちゃらちゃら
